  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam: Supporting women-led businesses in accessing European markets through e-commerce</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam&apos;s e-commerce market has grown rapidly, presenting significant opportunities for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs), especially women-led businesses. Despite this, women entrepreneurs face numerous challenges, such as limited financial resources, digital literacy, and access to e-commerce platforms. This project seeks to address these barriers, offering training and support to women-led businesses to enhance their capabilities in cross-border e-commerce, particularly in the European market.</narrative>
  </description>
